;
; OPA836IDBVR -- Texas Instruments single 205 MHz VFB op-amp, SOT-23-6 (DBV)
;
; Pin table transcribed from datasheets/OPA836IDBVR_SUMMARY.md.
; This SOT-23-6 pinout is vendor-specific -- do NOT substitute a generic
; SOT-23-6 op-amp symbol.
; NOTE (low confidence, carried over from the summary, name NOT altered):
;   * PD (pin 5) -- power-down/disable control. Its active-high vs active-low
;     polarity was NOT verified; the pin is therefore drawn with a plain
;     (non-inverted) input style. Design intent: tie PD to VS+ (3.3V) for
;     always-on operation; confirm polarity against the TI Pin Functions table
;     before board spin.
;
device OPA836IDBVR
Reference: U
Value: OPA836IDBVR
Footprint: Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-23-6
Datasheet: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/opa836.pdf
Description: Single 205MHz low-power rail-to-rail output VFB op-amp with power-down, SOT-23-6
keywords: opamp single high-speed amplifier power-down
fp_filters: SOT?23*

    left
        i       VIN+    3
        i       VIN-    4
        *
        i       PD      5

    right
        o       VOUT    1

    top
        p       VS+     6

    bottom
        p       VS-     2
